# Generated candidate eval cases are an EPHEMERAL human-review queue, not source.
# The learning loop (app/learning/growth.py + analyze.py) writes them here; a
# reviewer promotes real ones into evals/golden/ via a gated PR. Keep the queue
# out of git, but track this file and the README that documents the workflow.
*.json
*.yaml
*.yml
!.gitignore
!README.md
